Alexander H. Montgomery wrote:
> I've been looking into measures of betweenness implemented in R, and 
> have only found so far Freeman's (1977/79) basic measure in the sna 
> portion of the statnet package. Has flow betweenness (Freeman et al 
> 1991) been implemented yet?
>

Not yet in statnet.  I'm in the last phases of the sna overhaul, and the 
new version will include most of the betweenness variants described in 
Brandes (2008).  However, flow betweenness is not currently in the list. 
  It would make a welcome addition, if someone wants to contribute it. 
Otherwise, I'll put it on the wishlist for subsequent releases....

-Carter

From buttsc at uci.edu  Mon Mar 30 00:24:49 2009
