Hi Sean.  The reason has to do with how the gof distance is  
implemented; it's done differently from the way the usual ergm terms  
are implemented.  There is no analogous term for the ergm function  
that I know of (it would have to be defined somewhat differently in  
any case), though perhaps someone else has written something I'm not  
aware of.

Dave


