Hi, Mario -

I haven't been able to replicate your error, and it seems to be building 
OK on all of the CRAN machines.  Whatever the issue is, it seems to 
involve the document conversion for brokerage.Rd; this file was causing 
a Mac issue earlier, but that particular problem was fixed.  One 
immediate suggestion is to update to R 2.9, since one difference between 
versions is that they have made a number of changes to the way the 
parser for their man pages works.  Generally, those changes have been in 
the direction of making the system less permissive, but they might have 
had some other, unanticipated side effects....

Hope that helps,

