Great, Sean.  With the necessary objects I was able to see the problem quickly:  your regioncomb object is a data frame, and the network attribute functions expect a vector.  So right after you read in regioncomb, insert the line:

regioncomb <- regioncomb[,1]

as a quick way to convert from a one-column data frame to a vector. Then you should get the expected results.

Steve





